{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27161","headline":"送袁肇归山阴 · 郑巢","name":"送袁肇归山阴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"论文意有违，寒雨洒行衣。\n南渡久谁语，後吟今独归。\n河帆因树落，沙鸟背潮飞。\n若值云门侣，多因宿翠微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑巢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}